b.add(S9, 344, "match", "Match the five Takotsubo synonyms — 1) Broken heart syndrome 2) Transient apical ballooning 3) Neurogenic myocardial stunning 4) Stress-induced CMP 5) Catecholamine-induced CMP … A) Third B) First C) Fifth D) Second E) Fourth", "1-B, 2-D, 3-A, 4-E, 5-C", ["1-D, 2-B, 3-A, 4-E, 5-C", "1-B, 2-A, 3-D, 4-E, 5-C", "1-B, 2-D, 3-E, 4-A, 5-C"], "The synonym list runs in that printed order.")
